ing#product","url":"https://www.flowmance.com/pricing","name":"Flowmance All Access","description":"Every Flowmance template on the platforms you pick: 1 platform, 2 platforms or All Access for Webflow, Framer, HTML, Next.js and Figma, paid quarterly, yearly or once for lifetime.","image":"https://www.flowmance.com/og/pricing.png","brand":{"@id":"https://www.flowmance.com/#organization"},"offers":{"@type":"AggregateOffer","priceCurrency":"USD","lowPrice":"49","highPrice":"499","offerCount":10,"availability":"https://schema.org/InStock","url":"https://www.flowmance.com/pricing"},"mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https://www.flowmance.com/pricing#webpage"}},{"@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://www.flowmance.com/pricing#faq","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does Flowmance cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Plans are priced by how many platforms you pick (1, 2, or All Access) and how you pay: $49, $69 or $79 a quarter, $119, $159 or $199 a year, or $249, $349 or $499 once for lifetime access (Framer alone is $149 for lifetime). All Access covers 400+ templates on Webflow, Framer, HTML, Next.js and Figma."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s the difference between the plans?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"1 platform and 2 platforms unlock every template on the platforms you choose. All Access unlocks all five: Webflow, Framer, HTML, Next.js and Figma, with 400+ designs and every new release."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why does picking three platforms give me all five?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Three platforms cost the same as All Access ($199 a year), so from the third platform on you simply get all five, including the Figma files."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Quarterly, yearly or lifetime: which should I choose?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Quarterly suits a single project. Yearly saves up to 42% compared with paying every quarter. Lifetime is one payment ($249, $349 or $499, or $149 for Framer alone), and every Lifetime plan comes with priority support and early access to new drops."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do new templates come with my plan?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Every new template released on your platforms is added to your plan, with nothing extra to pay."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How many templates can I download?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Quarterly plans include 2 template downloads per day, yearly plans 5 and lifetime plans 10."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use the templates for client work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Every plan includes a commercial license for unlimited personal and client projects. Reselling, redistributing or repackaging the templates isn’t allowed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I pay, and can I cancel?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Visa, Mastercard, American Express and Apple Pay, through Lemon Squeezy. Quarterly and yearly plans can be canceled anytime. Lifetime is a single payment with no renewals."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does a free account include?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Every free template (one free template download a day), all the icons and LogoFree logos, favorites, and the design systems of the free templates. No card needed. Upgrade when you need the full library."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which plans include design systems?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Every plan includes the design systems of the templates on its platforms, and All Access includes all of them. Buying a single template includes its design system too: the link is in your order email. The free templates' design systems are free with an account."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your refund policy?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Digital purchases are final once payment is complete, subject to applicable law. Cancel a plan anytime to stop renewals; access continues to the end of the paid period. Try the free templates and live previews first to make sure Flowmance fits your work."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are there free Webflow templates available?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We offer a selection of free Webflow templates so you can test the experience. Full-library access is available through Flowmance All Access."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are there free Framer templates available?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We offer a selection of free Framer templates so you can test the experience. Full-library access is available through Flowmance All Access."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are there free Figma templates available?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We offer a selection of free Figma templates so you can test the experience. Full-library access is available through Flowmance All Access."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are the icons and logos free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The 8,700+ icons (Lucide, Phosphor and Tabler) and the LogoFree logos are free with a Flowmance account: copy or download them as SVG. The icons keep their open-source licenses (ISC and MIT)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I customize a Webflow Template?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Open the template in Webflow Designer and edit everything visually: text, colors, images, and layouts update live on screen. We use variables for spacing, fonts, and colors to make customization faster and consistent. You can also add custom code or tracking scripts in Webflow settings without breaking anything."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are Webflow templates flexible for different industries?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. You can customize everything fast: colors, fonts, layouts, and sections. Templates work for SaaS, services, agencies, portfolios, and more. Basic Webflow skills help, but if you don’t have time, we offer customization support."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do Webflow templates support SEO?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. They’re built with clean code, responsive structure, and fast load times, giving you a strong SEO base from day one."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Webflow templates be used for e-commerce?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Many of our Webflow templates are compatible with Webflow Ecommerce. You can add products, set pricing, and start accepting payments once your site is on a Webflow Ecommerce plan. You can also connect Webflow with Shopify if you prefer using Shopify’s checkout and commerce features."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do Webflow templates support CMS Collections?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. You can use CMS Collections for blogs, portfolios, services, careers, case studies, and more. Most Flowmance Webflow templates include CMS Collections for these, ready to fill in."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I edit a Framer template?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Just open the template in Framer and edit visually on the canvas. Change text, images, styles, and sections in a few clicks. The templates are flexible for SaaS, services, startups, consulting, portfolios, and multiple design styles."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are animations editable in Framer templates?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Framer lets you edit or remove animations easily. You can change speed, style, timing, and movement without any coding."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are Framer templates responsive?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Every Framer template is crafted to be responsive from the start, delivering a polished experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile with zero extra effort."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Framer templates be used for SaaS, agencies, and portfolios?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Framer templates work great for portfolios, agencies, and SaaS. They include modern layouts, sections for work and services, plus SaaS components like pricing, features, and dashboards."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are Figma templates beginner friendly?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Figma templates are easy to open and customize. You can modify styles, colors, text, and layouts without needing advanced design skills."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do Figma templates come with styles and components?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Our Figma templates include color styles, typography systems, and reusable components, so you can design faster and stay consistent."}}]}]}</script><section class="panel at-head ac-head" aria-labelledby="at-h"><div class="at-copy"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><span style="display:contents"><a href="/">Home</a><svg class="car" viewBox="0 0 8 10" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1.5 1.2v7.6c0 .6.7.9 1.2.5l4.6-3.8a.65.65 0 0 0 0-1L2.7.7C2.2.3 1.5.6 1.5 1.2z"></path></svg></span><span aria-current="page">Pricing</span></nav><span class="ac-badge"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/icons.svg#i-h-flash"></use></svg>All Access</span><h1 id="at-h">Choose your access.<!-- --> <span>Start creating.</span></h1><p class="lede">Pick your platforms and how you’d like to pay. Choose three or more and you unlock all five, with 400+ designs and every new release.</p><div class="ac-cta"><a class="btn btn-accent btn-lg" href="#pricing">Build your plan</a><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="#compare">Compare plans</a></div><div class="ac-stats"><div><b>400+</b><small>Templates</small></div><div><b>5</b><small>Platforms</small></div><div><b>$<!-- -->49</b><small>Lowest plan / quarter</small></div></div></div><div class="ac-art"><svg class="iso-svg ps-svg" viewBox="-120 -115 314 271" role="img" aria-label="The Flowmance All Access card"><defs><pattern id="iso-hatch" width="5" height="5" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(45)"><line class="s